  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FPolka%20Dot%20Gift.png\" title=\"Polka Dot Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Polka Dot Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Polka Dot Gift</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>holly</span><span title=\"Holly\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"holly\"><img alt=\"holly\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Holly.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20221206145759\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  10m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 87</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Gift Wrapping Station</span><span title=\"Gift wrapping station\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8m</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br>\n<b>Polka Dot Gift</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 20. It's a special item used only for the Christmas event. In 2025 event, it is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 50.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Polka Dot Gifts</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FGift%20Wrapping%20Station%202024.png\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station 2024\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station 2024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"127\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Gift Wrapping Station 2024</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Polka Dot Gifts are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Wrapping Station</a>.\n</p><p>To make a polka dot gift in the Christmas 2024 event, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-woolly-hat-2250\" title=\"Blue woolly hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue woolly hat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/raspberry-2243\" title=\"Raspberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Raspberry\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-14254\" title=\"Cotton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cotton\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make one gift, and 8 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> station. Each gift gives players 87 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>To make a polka dot gift in the <b>Christmas 2025 event</b>, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/starry-gift-36479\" title=\"Starry Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Starry Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-cheese-2297\" title=\"Goat Cheese\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Cheese\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a gift. Each treat gives players 113 experience points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 gift per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each gift used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 <a href=\"/wiki/holly-35688\" title=\"Holly\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">holly</a>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831215752\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 924/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2680/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766253/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.447      1 -total\n 81.90%   49.509      1 Template:Infobox\n 32.84%   19.849      6 Template:Infoicon\n  9.12%    5.514      1 Template:Navigation\n  3.50%    2.117      1 Template:Languages\n  2.30%    1.388      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  2.29%    1.387      4 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36299-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831215752 and revision id 108957. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
